blem "The axis of symmetry of the parabola $y=4{x}^{2}+3x+2$ is $x=${{field-1}}."] ["question-ff16fd72-aa33-5ed0-9859-414065a202fe" :question/worked-solution "The equation of the axis of symmetry of the parabola $y=a{x}^{2}+bx+c$ is given by\n\n$$\nx=-\\frac{b}{2a}.\n$$\n\nWe substitute $a=4$ and $b=3$ into the formula for the axis of symmetry. This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =-\\frac{3}{2(4)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the axis of symmetry is $x=-\\frac{3}{8}.$"] ["question-ff16fd72-aa33-5ed0-9859-414065a202fe" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-0ac0919c-bc03-5eb1-b683-8e74321045e2" :answer-field/id #uuid "0ac0919c-bc03-5eb1-b683-8e74321045e2"] ["answer-4295ee61-6048-53f9-9797-3fb92b43b5bd" :answer/id #uuid "4295ee61-6048-53f9-9797-3fb92b43b5bd"] ["answer-4295ee61-6048-53f9-9797-3fb92b43b5bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4295ee61-6048-53f9-9797-3fb92b43b5bd" :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{8}"] ["answer-field-0ac0919c-bc03-5eb1-b683-8e74321045e2" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-0ac0919c-bc03-5eb1-b683-8e74321045e2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-0ac0919c-bc03-5eb1-b683-8e74321045e2" :answer-field/correct "answer-4295ee61-6048-53f9-9797-3fb92b43b5bd"] ["answer-field-0ac0919c-bc03-5eb1-b683-8e74321045e2" :answer-field/choices "answer-4295ee61-6048-53f9-9797-3fb92b43b5bd"] ["question-ff16fd72-aa33-5ed0-9859-414065a202fe" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-0ac0919c-bc03-5eb1-b683-8e74321045e2"] [17592186083186 :knowledge-point/questions "question-ff16fd72-aa33-5ed0-9859-414065a202fe"] ["question-7a249418-3166-5952-aa2e-ffdd779176d1" :question/id #uuid "7a249418-3166-5952-aa2e-ffdd779176d1"] ["question-7a249418-3166-5952-aa2e-ffdd779176d1" :question/math-academy-id "q-106539"] ["question-7a249418-3166-5952-aa2e-ffdd779176d1" :question/problem "Find the axis of symmetry for the parabola $y=2{x}^{2}+8x-3.$"] ["question-7a249418-3166-5952-aa2e-ffdd779176d1" :question/worked-solution "The equation of the axis of symmetry of the parabola $y=a{x}^{2}+bx+c$ is given by\n\n$$\nx=-\\frac{b}{2a}.\n$$\n\nWe substitute $a=2$ and $b=8$ into the formula for the axis of symmetry. This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =-\\frac{8}{2(2)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{8}{4} \\\\  & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the axis of symmetry is $x=-2.$"] ["question-7a249418-3166-5952-aa2e-ffdd779176d1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-58080bed-1ac2-5652-ab76-b460fa71e917" :answer-field/id #uuid "58080bed-1ac2-5652-ab76-b460fa71e917"] ["answer-df7c299f-a11e-5927-ad5b-bcd08a02bd4e" :answer/id #uuid "df7c299f-a11e-5927-ad5b-bcd08a02bd4e"] ["answer-df7c299f-a11e-5927-ad5b-bcd08a02bd4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-df7c299f-a11e-5927-ad5b-bcd08a02bd4e" :answer/value "x=-2"] ["answer-dace083e-ae80-5311-9205-e754e34dc1f4" :answer/id #uuid "dace083e-ae80-5311-9205-e754e34dc1f4"] ["answer-dace083e-ae80-5311-9205-e754e34dc1f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-dace083e-ae80-5311-9205-e754e34dc1f4" :answer/value "x=-4"] ["answer-b1fbd0b0-1be4-52eb-a17b-70d994f0ef95" :answer/id #uuid "b1fbd0b0-1be4-52eb-a17b-70d994f0ef95"] ["answer-b1fbd0b0-1be4-52eb-a17b-70d994f0ef95" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b1fbd0b0-1be4-52eb-a17b-70d994f0ef95" :answer/value "x=-\\frac{1}{2}"] ["answer-366f61ee-82b5-511f-9834-78fe121c414a" :answer/id #uuid "366f61ee-82b5-511f-9834-78fe121c414a"] ["answer-366f61ee-82b5-511f-9834-78fe121c414a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-366f61ee-82b5-511f-9834-78fe121c414a" :answer/value "x=2"] ["answer-404b7834-6467-595c-8689-798a9dd0ba2b" :answer/id #uuid "404b7834-6467-595c-8689-798a9dd0ba2b"] ["answer-404b7834-6467-595c-8689-798a9dd0ba2b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-404b7834-6467-595c-8689-798a9dd0ba2b" :answer/value "x=\\frac{1}{2}"] ["answer-field-58080bed-1ac2-5652-ab76-b460fa71e917" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-58080be